background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Head Style</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">Round</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- table布局 -->\n</div>\n<!-- 第二条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic-p\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<!-- table布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\" data-mce-style=\"padding: 0;\" style=\"padding: 0;\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" data-mce-style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold;\" style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold;\">\n<!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-style=\"height: 19px;\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Quantity</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"height: 19px;\" style=\"height: 19px;\">10 pcs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-style=\"height: 19px;\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Certification</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"height: 19px;\" style=\"height: 19px;\">CE, ROHS</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- table布局 -->\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 如需添加在此处添加 -->\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<p> </p>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Product Feature</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>High Quality:</strong> Made from durable stainless steel, providing exceptional strength and reliable resistance in various environments.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Excellent Functionality: </strong>Ideal for delivering consistent pressure and ensuring precise positioning.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Easy to Use: </strong>Easy to install and convenient to use—simply press it in for secure fastening.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Wide Application: </strong>Versatile for use in mechanical devices, clamps, automatic machines, and more.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"><br/></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Consideration</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Ensure the 3D printed parts have holes matching the size of the plain ball plunger screw.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Maintain precise tolerances for a proper fit and smooth operation.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "High Quality: Made from durable stainless steel, providing exceptional strength and reliable resistance in various environments.\n\nExcellent Functionality: Ideal for delivering consistent pressure and ensuring precise positioning.\n\nEasy to Use: Easy to install and convenient to use—simply press it in for secure fastening.\n\nWide Application: Versatile for use in mechanical devices, clamps, automatic machines, and more.\n\nEnsure the 3D printed parts have holes matching the size of the plain ball plunger screw.\n\nMaintain precise tolerances for a proper fit and smooth operation.",
